    "composition": "The pinned Linux x64 glibc build compiles its selected dependencies as static libraries, applies the recorded upstream patches from build/posix.sh, links them into the shared libvips-cpp.so.8.18.7, and packages that library plus headers and versions.json. proxy-libintl is recorded because it appears in versions.json and the upstream notice inventory, but its conditional build is not selected for glibc. Highway is built with HWY_ENABLE_CONTRIB=0, so its CC0-1.0 contrib file is not compiled.",
